# Copy to .env (git-ignored) and fill in. Never commit .env.
# 1) https://discord.com/developers/applications -> New Application -> Bot -> Reset Token -> paste below.
#    Under "Privileged Gateway Intents" turn ON "Message Content Intent".
# 2) OAuth2 -> URL Generator: scopes "bot"; permissions "View Channels", "Send Messages", "Read Message History",
#    "Add Reactions", "Attach Files". Open the URL and invite the bot to your server.
# 3) In your server: Settings -> Advanced -> Developer Mode ON; right-click the channel -> Copy Channel ID.
# 4) Channel -> Edit -> Integrations -> Webhooks -> New Webhook -> Copy Webhook URL.
DISCORD_BOT_TOKEN=
DISCORD_CHANNEL_ID=
DISCORD_WEBHOOK_URL=
HERDR_TARGET=wZ:p1
